-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §4: commencement on 1.9.08 (save provisions
-- that start earlier), the fixed term until the reform is complete on
-- 1.9.2013, and work under the reform in תשס"ח counting as such.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
IMPORT conventions

§ `4`

@ref akn:art_4__para_a
`the agreement commences on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2008

-- A provision may start before 1.9.08 where it says so; its own start date
-- is then the one given.
GIVEN `the provision's own start` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `a provision starts on` `the provision's own start` IS
    CONSIDER `the provision's own start`
    WHEN JUST d THEN d
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `the agreement commences on`

-- 4(ב): the fixed term lasts until the reform is complete, "דהיינו עד
-- 1.9.2013" (convention dates.end: the last day is in it).
@ref akn:art_4__para_b
`the fixed term ends on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2013

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `within the fixed term` d IF
        d `is on or after` `the agreement commences on`
    AND `the fixed term ends on` `is on or after` d

-- 4(ג): a period of work under the reform in the school year תשס"ח counts
-- as work under the reform for every purpose, this agreement's included.
@ref akn:art_4__para_c
GIVEN `worked under the reform in 5768` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `counts as work under the reform` `worked under the reform in 5768` IF
    `worked under the reform in 5768`

#ASSERT `within the fixed term` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2013)
#ASSERT NOT `within the fixed term` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2008)
#ASSERT `a provision starts on` (JUST (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2007)) EQUALS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2007
#ASSERT `a provision starts on` NOTHING EQUALS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2008
